In addition to CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (or, for Software, the Software Terms in Section 12), this Content is subject to the supplemental terms in Sections 2–10 below (the "Supplemental Terms"). The CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license, the Software Terms and the Supplemental Terms together form the QNFO Unified License Agreement ("this Agreement"). They shall be read and enforced as a single, integrated agreement. In the event of any conflict between CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 and the Supplemental Terms, the Supplemental Terms shall prevail.

