CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 licenses no patents. For Software, Licensor grants You a worldwide, royalty-free, non-exclusive license under every patent claim that Licensor owns or controls, now or later, and that is necessarily infringed by the Software as Licensor distributes it. The license covers making, using, running and Distributing the Software for the non-commercial purposes this Agreement permits. It does not extend to Commercial Use, which requires a separate agreement under Section 10.7. If You, or anyone acting on Your behalf, start a lawsuit, arbitration or other proceeding alleging that the Software infringes a patent, every license this Agreement grants You ends on the date the claim is filed. Section 5 (Patent Prior Art Citation) applies to Software in full. This Section is an express grant for the purposes of Section 7.5.

